specific capabilities

49
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:09,680
or tendencies that might not be
immediately apparent. This

50
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:14,210
often involves scaffolding providing
supporting structures or tools that

51
00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:17,930
help the model demonstrate its full
capabilities. The core

52
00:03:17,930 --> 00:03:20,009
goal is to get the model to display its

53
00:03:20,009 --> 00:03:24,090
maximum abilities using whatever
techniques that we can then

54
00:03:24,090 --> 00:03:27,568
evaluators can make stronger safety
guarantees as compared to

55
00:03:27,568 --> 00:03:30,930
evaluating just the base model. There are
some techniques

56
00:03:30,930 --> 00:03:36,090
being created to automate scaffolding
elicitation, supervised fine tuning,

57
00:03:36,090 --> 00:03:40,219
and agent based evaluations similar to
benchmarks. We can't

58
