Multi Step Reasoning Inference

89
00:05:39,209 --> 00:05:41,970
Time scaling helps us get a better
understanding of

90
00:05:41,970 --> 00:05:46,370
a model's true capabilities. As a concrete
example, it

91
00:05:46,370 --> 00:05:48,529
has been observed that when a model learns
two

92
00:05:48,529 --> 00:05:53,529
facts separately, A, B and bc, the model's
weights

93
00:05:53,529 --> 00:05:58,129
don't automatically encode the transitive
connection ac even though

94
00:05:58,129 --> 00:06:02,180
the model knows both component pieces. By
