98
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:15,139
prompting, we might incorrectly conclude a
model lacks certain

99
00:06:15,139 --> 00:06:18,420
reasoning abilities when in fact it just
needs scaffolding

100
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:23,100
to demonstrate them. Understanding these
architectural limitations helps us

101
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:26,699
design better evaluation techniques that
can reveal a model's

102
00:06:26,699 --> 00:06:30,980
true capabilities. Combinations and
variations of this technique have

103
00:06:30,980 --> 00:06:33,939
already been used to train models like
OpenAI O

104
00:06:33,939 --> 00:06:39,740
series, DeepSeq's reasoning series of
