155
00:09:58,309 --> 00:10:04,149
For example, WebGPT when embedded in agent
frameworks. This

156
00:10:04,149 --> 00:10:08,190
highlights why dangerous capability
evaluations should include both fine

157
00:10:08,190 --> 00:10:13,000
