prompting based elicitation techniques

158
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:16,879
or agent scaffolds to establish more
comprehensive upper bounds

159
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:21,960
on model capabilities. Elicitation
Technique Tool Augmentation this is

160
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:25,320
an elicitation technique that involves
providing models with access

161
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:29,200
