168
00:10:51,330 --> 00:10:55,730
instructions and returns results. This
approach is particularly valuable

169
00:10:55,809 --> 00:10:59,289
for capability evaluation as it reveals
what models can

170
00:10:59,289 --> 00:11:04,059
