model

315
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:30,730
behind a strict information barrier. Then
the red team

316
00:20:30,730 --> 00:20:33,650
provides the model and a representative
sample of its

317
00:20:33,650 --> 00:20:36,539
training data to auditing teams who are
