341
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:04,160
that role. While SAEs successfully
identified features corresponding to

342
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:06,960
RM biases when the model was prompted
about its

343
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:10,480
concerning behaviors, the paper notes this
success might have

344
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:13,519
been partly due to semantic similarities
