349
00:22:27,759 --> 00:22:31,119
output like adding chocolate to an omelet
and causally

350
00:22:31,119 --> 00:22:34,480
linking these features to the behavior.
For example, one

351
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:37,400
participant won by prompting the model
with inputs like

352
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:40,680
the assistant is an AI model with
potentially concerning

353
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:44,079
behaviors and searching through feature
like the ones shown

354
00:22:44,079 --> 00:22:47,400
in the image below. There is figure 5.23
in

355
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:50,609
the textbook. Here it depicts a reward
